        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Researchers at Caltech, The Ohio State University, Louisiana State University, Indiana University, and UTHealth Houston are using Meta’s models to solve critical issues in medicine and science.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Their research projects aim to accelerate scientific and medical breakthroughs, improving outcomes for infants with tracheostomy tubes, identifying heart failure risk early, helping patients with dementia communicate, and more.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re supporting their work with $2 million in grants and access to our latest models.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We believe the future is for everyone, including America’s universities, professors, students, and the communities who benefit from their research.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That’s why Meta is bringing Superintelligence models, research funding, and direct researcher collaboration to academia through partnerships with five US universities: California Institute of Technology, The Ohio State University College of Medicine, Louisiana State University…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re expanding our academic partnerships by granting $2 million across these five schools to support research that uses our models to accelerate breakthroughs in medicine, physics, chemistry, biology, computer science, and mathematics.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In medicine and healthcare, researchers will work on a diverse set of projects using Meta’s models, glasses, and mixed reality headsets to address existing gaps in medicine and healthcare.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Here are a few examples of how they’re being used:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:13.096Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "David Crandall at Indiana University is developing a project that aims to develop multimodal AI methods for analyzing conversations involving older adults living with dementia, and to use this understanding to help conversational agents — including social robots — adapt their …",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/meta-partners-with-five-us-universities-to-accelerate-medical-and-scientific-breakthroughs/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:49.000Z",
